# Physics receipt: Stress, a spring between every connected pair at its graph
# distance. Its signature is a metric picture: the fixture's farthest pair is
# four hops apart, and ends at least two and a half mean edge lengths apart
# on the canvas (a local law leaves it near one and a half).
assert title GRAPHSHELL H3 READY
assert snap ready == true
dom click [data-command="toggle-physics"]
settle 1
assert snap physics-paused == false
# No arrangement: the boot Spiral's anchor springs would pull under every law.
select #gs-arrangement-select free
dom click [data-command="apply-arrangement"]
settle 1
assert snap layout == free
select #gs-physics-select stress.kamada-kawai
dom click [data-command="apply-physics"]
settle 1
assert snap physics-law == stress.kamada-kawai
assert snap physics-profile == law.stress
capture physics_stress_start
wait
settle 60
capture physics_stress_settled
wait
settle 300
assert snap layout-stretch >= 2.5
assert snap layout-overlaps == 0
log physics stress receipt complete
